WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.380
Your final sentence deserves your best care.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.330
Capital at the start.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.150
A complete thought.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.430
The right mark at the end.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.110
Read it out loud.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:14.340
If it sounds like you, it’s ready.
